{"sha":"b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","node_id":"C_kwDOAWaYQdoAKGI2MzhmYzBkZTM1MTk4N2YzZWFmZmEyYmRhYmQzOTNjODY3OWE5ZTg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Robert Ream","email":"robertream@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-09T20:28:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-09T20:28:32Z"},"message":"feat(http2): add an executor getter for server and client (#4250)\n\n`Builder::new(exec)` is the only constructor on either HTTP/2 builder and the\nexecutor cannot be read back, so a caller that needs it for work alongside a\nconnection keeps a second copy with nothing relating the two.\n\n`impl<E> Builder<E>` is unconstrained, so the accessor needs no bound, and\nreturning `&E` leaves cloning to the caller.\n\nSigned-off-by: katelyn martin <git@katelyn.world>","tree":{"sha":"ae901243bbe058ffd2ea7e5d993aa73d675f18fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/git/trees/ae901243bbe058ffd2ea7e5d993aa73d675f18fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/git/commits/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq8izwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6X0QABnO63QDpNgaSEgxpOUbX3Rf\nOtPLBjod+XxaOlatiCK3yLFhuYFsFyWAYB1Ywa3xiIsZK+5NFWKqLeAlHnDQT1Gu\nFypHl5KiqpDaNEWRiVECZHe8Mb+LxHfdrmgmBsN3iqSLDERDbDtJowgOTseY+Pkf\n8pmOwG+KgIWQu70sJ4lnmA1qEhWpkS/9wvDYPp8KW+NRK6LkIZ7yg2dJpf+uFBY6\nYNJCoEMczsAbh3fndimw0uSUMKNAulrWJRMBOAoIgkNNFHOMvWJs1fz1D6N6wgNj\nvSGn/40l/uSPdzqjJPFGRquBD7cjvPhkIXITBBKTqoedvFnJujjWy/ZTvmGZUTjW\n/cJNGF5kSVtAgiBJuIwcQC27p/X/tB43YyzBJcftvGH1zjYK01yO2Phch3TCBoTR\nKbVAnmEj/PKng9AgjEAo8U6+lCF9VdGuRv0Cz4fgUkKIHgxDZLJPWEMrjlMDzQNN\nNrBY1Jfc43tSuHB0NDvgxiJRtm7syfV+TEqZRFeAZ9zLT7xsp1Z/vuUcuYtwXWJB\nlVvlbo0c5i/4LhZl7nnboebOJlzwnAVhmG7LctAoNufKgt3/6+s8dcmnXM6HIg4s\nhyF8DMV0Vph5zbMwmgQYq//IyuiV0gUcH+LTiidPJA46Z+MnXm3RIQFK7e7LeWMb\naM/RT2m9NCSSN5WnAgXm\n=4H99\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ae901243bbe058ffd2ea7e5d993aa73d675f18fb\nparent c5e100ca0d5497a021894215bad9222099c32203\nauthor Robert Ream <robertream@gmail.com> 1794256112 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1794256112 -0500\n\nfeat(http2): add an executor getter for server and client (#4250)\n\n`Builder::new(exec)` is the only constructor on either HTTP/2 builder and the\nexecutor cannot be read back, so a caller that needs it for work alongside a\nconnection keeps a second copy with nothing relating the two.\n\n`impl<E> Builder<E>` is unconstrained, so the accessor needs no bound, and\nreturning `&E` leaves cloning to the caller.\n\nSigned-off-by: katelyn martin <git@katelyn.world>","verified_at":"2026-11-09T20:28:33Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/commits/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","html_url":"https://github.com/hyperium/hyper/commit/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hyperium/hyper/commits/b638fc0de351987f3eaffa2bdabd393c8679a9e8/comments","author":{"login":"robertream","id":154010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDAxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream","html_url":"https://github.com/robertream","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertream/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-